## Notes for the raise (not for the model)

- **This is a PARTIAL of KS-1188: F1b only** (the `GET /api/users/me` family head). Still open: **F1a** (`GET
  /api/auth/mfa/status`, product `routes/mfa.ts`, its own brief `split_1188F1a`), **F2** (held: READY_KS-1188-F2) and **F3**
  (the backup-code burn order, a product decision). The PR says "Refs KS-1188 (F1b)", never "Closes".
